From 98cc6910357ad6a1629367ee7f88695d36c31d97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:40:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] A Rogue's off-hand and finisher trails can be drawn wider and
 longer-lived

Basin Battle, the thirty-third round (HasActionCombat() 33). A hand's trail colour in
PlayUnitAnimation's "main/off" form may end "*N" (1 to 4): that hand's ribbon is N times as wide,
drawn out from the blade's middle, and its swing fades slower, living 1 + 0.6 (N - 1) times as long.
No mark is the blade's own ribbon, as before. A trail that arms again goes back to the blade's width.
The off hand's deeper steel did not read a few yards off.
